      "content": [
        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "**NIST AI 600-1**  \n官方URL：https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.600-1.pdf （DOI：https://doi.org/10.6028/NIST.AI.600-1 ；NIST页面：https://www.nist.gov/publications/artificial-intelligence-risk-management-framework-generative-artificial-intelligence）[[1]](https://www.nist.gov/publications/artificial-intelligence-risk-management-framework-generative-artificial-intelligence)  \n发布日期：2024年7月26日（编辑委员会批准2024-07-25）。[[2]](https://doi.org/10.6028/NIST.AI.600-1)  \n工程风险（编造/过度信任）：Confabulation（幻觉/编造）及Human-AI Configuration中的过度依赖。  \n原文位置：第2节“Overview of Risks Unique to or Exacerbated by GAI”，条目2（TOC标为p.6）及条目7。  \n支持片段：“2. Confabulation: The production of confidently stated but erroneous or false content (known colloquially as “hallucinations” or “fabrications”) by which users may be misled or deceived.”“7. Human-AI Configuration: Arrangements of or interactions between a human and an AI system which can result in the human ... experiencing ... automation bias, over-reliance...”[[3]](https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.600-1.pdf)\n\n**GitHub Responsible use of GitHub Copilot code review**  \n官方URL：https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/responsible-use/agents （覆盖Copilot code review的Application card；相关使用页https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/use-code-review）  \n发布日期：未注明日期（持续更新文档）。  \n工程风险（漏检/错误建议）：漏检问题及幻觉/错误建议。  \n原文位置：第7节 Limitations。  \n支持片段：“Missed code quality problems: Copilot may not identify all of the problems that are present in code, especially where changes are large or complex. To ensure that all relevant problems are identified and corrected, Copilot code review should be supplemented with careful human code review.”“False positives: Copilot code review has a risk of hallucination—it may highlight problems in reviewed code that do not exist or are based on misunderstandings of the code.”“Inaccurate or insecure code suggestions: ... The code generated may appear to be valid but may not actually be semantically or syntactically correct...” “Use Copilot code review to supplement human reviews, not to replace them.”[[4]](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/responsible-use/agents)\n\n（约380字，仅原始官方资料，未扩展。）",
